<%# The decision row of a review card, holding only the decisions that END it: the
    caller supplies the commit first (primary) and the quiet way out last — a
    dismissal must never be as loud as the thing it dismisses, and CSS pushes that
    last one to the far end. A control that asks for another go leaves the card in
    play, so it belongs with the controls it acts on (see shared/_card_aside). %>
<div class="action-bar"><%= yield %></div>
